  "deletedBy": null,
  "details": "At present, the Action Menu (the radial menu that appears when you hold a menu button) is seemingly fully head locked when used in the `On HUD` mode, where it is locked to the HMD rather than attached to the controller (`Menu Button Hold/Options/Action Menu/on HUD`).\n\nThis can be seen if you move the menu over the HUD's mic and gesture icons, which do have burn in prevention (the icons wiggle around a bit, slightly detached from HMD movement).\n\nThis presents a possible burn-in threat, especially on (micro)OLED HMDs. It'd be nice to see the Action Menu get the same treatment as the other HUD icons, especially as somebody who usually has those wheels up in my HUD in my Bigscreen Beyond.",
